==Battleground==
*1 [[Balrog (Enemy)|Balrog]] spawns as the boss after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 4~6 seconds<sup>120f~180f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Balrog is only at 7% magnification and the peons only 100%.

